  "description": "Roll-up tonneau covers are a versatile and affordable way to protect your payload. Roll-up tonneau covers are quick and easy and offer all the protective features of a tonneau at an affordable price. The roll-up tonneau cover is designed for convenience, offering tool-free installation.\nFeatures\nProtect your truck bed. OEDRO's roll-up soft truck bed cover provides your pickup truck with the perfect combination of safety, convenience, and appearance. With the help of the tailgate latch system and the velcro strips sealed on both sides, your truck bed instantly becomes a 100% snow, rain, UV, and dust-resistant luggage compartment.\nHeavy-duty PVC material. OEDRO's truck tonneau cover is made of double-layer PVC, which has been thoroughly tested to provide UV protection and excellent tensile properties. Includes pre-assembled powder-coated rails and aluminum clips for trouble-free installation and strong stability.\nNo need to drill. No drill clamps to fix the trunk lid rails to the floor of your truck. The installation can be completed within 20-30 minutes using a wrench and socket.\nAerodynamic profile. The tonneau cover is installed on top of your bed railing to provide maximum cargo space and waterproof performance.\n1-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended\nFitment\nCompatible with 2005-2026 Nissan Frontier Fleetside 5ft Bed.\nONLY FIT Utili-Track System / NOT FOR México Ver.",
